  {
    "id": 7858644320499,
    "title": "The Body Wedge (2 of any size)",
    "handle": "the-body-wedge-2-of-any-size",
    "body_html": "<div class=\"product-details-module__content\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div class=\"product-details__product-description\" id=\"productDescription\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Two is always better than one\u2026</strong></div>\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\">The Body Wedge comes in three different sizes (small/medium, medium/large, large/X-large). You can massage the abdominal region from different angles and planes therefore having the right tools improve efficiency to providing needed relief.</div>\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Sharing is also caring. You don\u2019t have to be the only person in the household receiving all the benefits of the Body Wedge. Different body types/heights will demand a Body Wedge of different sizes. You receive at least a 6% discount when you purchase 2 Body Wedges.</div>\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></div>\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Are you ready to Release Your POWER?</strong></div>\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\u201cMassage your core and move\u201d is the solution. Using the Body Wedge will help you expose the underlying cause of referred Back \u2013 Hip -Knee pain. You can be proactive or reactive in addressing the sitting phenomenon, that is crippling the human body, in the comfort of your own home. You might not know of all the tension you are carrying in the abdominal area. You definitely should use the Body Wedge if you are experiencing any of these issue:</div>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Anxiety</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Back pain</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Constipation</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Dis-ease</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Headaches</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Joint pain</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Poor blood flow</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Rapid degeneration</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Joint Pain</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Stiffness</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Weak muscles</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">You will be able to RESTORE natural ease of movement, MAINTAIN functional movements, RECOVER quickly from workouts, REDUCE headaches, LESSEN depression and anxiety, ALLEVIATE lower-back pain all and much more by just spending 5 \u2013 10 minutes a day taking care of you. It can starts with this one purchase but int he meantime, please stand frequently; exercise regularly; get a full-body massage; laugh often; use your legs to walk, run and jog.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<img data-mce-fragment=\"1\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0667/2200/5235/files/size_chart_480x480.png?v=1701927992\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0667/2200/5235/files/size_chart_480x480.png?v=1701927992\">",
