    "body_html": "<div class=\"product-details-module__content\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div class=\"product-details-module__content\">\n<div id=\"productDescription\" class=\"product-details__product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>Want to relieve pain and correct dysfunction?</strong></div>\n<div>The Body Wedge Kit brings you an exclusive tool, The Body Wedge. Using this tool and the 10 others in this kit, you will be able to identify and relieve trigger points in the comfort of your own home.</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div><strong>Are you ready to Release Your POWER?</strong></div>\n<div>\u201cMassage your core and move\u201d is the solution. Using the Body Wedge will help you expose the underlying cause of referred Back \u2013 Hip -Knee pain. You can be proactive or reactive in addressing the sitting phenomenon, that is crippling the human body, in the comfort of your own home. You might not know of all the tension you are carrying in the abdominal area. You definitely should use the Body Wedge if you are experiencing any of these issue:</div>\n<ul>\n<li>Anxiety</li>\n<li>Back pain</li>\n<li>Constipation</li>\n<li>Dis-ease</li>\n<li>Headaches</li>\n<li>Joint pain</li>\n<li>Poor blood flow</li>\n<li>Rapid degeneration</li>\n<li>Joint Pain</li>\n<li>Stiffness</li>\n<li>Weak muscles</li>\n</ul>\n<div>You will be able to address they whole body with the various tools and instructional video. You will become intuitively capable with addressing your own personal muscular issues when it comes to YOUR body. Understanding myofascial adhesion, the difference between a weak muscle or a tight muscle will give you skills that will carry on into other lifetimes. Knowledge is power so share it.</div>\n<div><strong>Your kit will include:</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>One Body Wedge of choice, manual included</li>\n<li>Foam block, 5-inch square</li>\n<li>Yoga mat, 24-inch square</li>\n<li>Rope, 4-feet knotted on both ends</li>\n<li>Foam roller, 12-inches long</li>\n<li>Golf ball</li>\n<li>Tennis ball</li>\n<li>Lacrosse ball</li>\n<li>Softball, 11-inches</li>\n<li>Baseball, rubber</li>\n<li>Basketball, mini</li>\n<li>Air pin</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n  <img data-mce-fragment=\"1\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0667/2200/5235/files/size_chart_480x480.png?v=1701927992\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0667/2200/5235/files/size_chart_480x480.png?v=1701927992\">\n</div>\n</div>",
